edDescription":"Unbelievably fast soccer (football) and volleyball simulator. Challenge your friends and prove them who is the best. Do you prefer soccer or volleyball, or maybe both? It's your chance to play on 8 different stadiums. Realistic physics makes Head Goal really fun, you can save your amazing actions on a replay and watch them later. Try the game and invite your friends to see who is the best Head Goal player in the world.\nFeatures:\n\n• 8 stadiums\n\n• 2 Game Modes (Soccer and Volleyball)\n\n• Multiplayer (PvP/Co-Op)\n\n• Realistic Physics\n\n• T-Shirts Customization\n\n• Replays\n\n• Statistics\n\nIf you like coop multi player esport games, this one is for you. It's an indie online pvp experience great for players who love competitive gaming. This fast-paced soccer sim offers great action arcade gameplay for casual and hardcore players. It's easy to play and hard to master. Feel free to try it if you want to spend fun time with your friends.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/header.jpg?t=1780315130"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780315130"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/ss_8a61c656697581ed4478e3371d4b8e7f9c64b857.600x338.jpg?t=1780315130","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/ss_8a61c656697581ed4478e3371d4b8e7f9c64b857.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780315130"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/ss_5b6d9884bbdaeed587b90833d6fea1679210a502.600x338.jpg?t=1780315130","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/687850/ss_5b6d9884bbdaeed587b90